<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef sharply lower on light to moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts lower, while rib cuts weak. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand. -USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>248 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 10 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>39 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     107.73	107.41	 99.95	 99.46</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.88	 -1.50	 -1.96	 -1.60</p>
<p>Rib	  170.04	170.33	154.84	153.47</p>
<p>Chuck	 75.72	 73.15	 73.08	 70.64</p>
<p>Round	 94.04	 94.04	 90.71	 90.71</p>
<p>Loin	 167.82	169.73	145.72	147.59</p>
